==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|iniuria|injūria|injury|lang=la}} + {{term|sine||without|lang=la}}  + {{term/t|la|damnō}}, ablative singular of {{term|damnum||financial or property loss|lang=la}}. Literally meaning "injury without financial loss".

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# a [[legal]] [[wrong]] that causes no [[actual]] [[damage]] or [[injury]] to anyone

